<title>USA: Panaco closes $33.6 mln stock offering.</title>
<headline>Panaco closes $33.6 mln stock offering.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panaco Inc said Friday it completed a $33.6 million common stock offering, consisting of six million newly issued shares and 2.4 million shares sold by its shareholders.</p>
<p>The purpose of the company's portion of the offering is to reduce long-term debt and to provide funds for future acquisitions and development of its properties.</p>
<p>Panaco is involved in oil and gas exploration and development onshore and offshore in Louisiana, Kansas, Texas and Oklahoma.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
